From 247f555e5048b8cdfa13af84e0b4f06a0dc24c4b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Price <thesamprice@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:52:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] opcodes: microblaze: tell bslli, bsrai and bsrli apart

OPCODE_MASK_H3B, the mask of the immediate barrel shifts, leaves out
bits 21:22 (0x600), the only bits that tell bslli, bsrai and bsrli
apart.  The bit_sequence of bslli and bsrai has bits outside the mask,
so the opcode lookup never matches them, and every immediate barrel
shift disassembles as bsrli.  The simulator and GDB decode through the
same table, so the simulator also runs bslli and bsrai as bsrli.  gas
does not read the mask, and its output does not change.

The mask came in with 2d1777b530d, first released in 2.42.  The new
value, 0xFC00FFE0, fixes bits 16:26, as QEMU's decoder does for these
three instructions.  OPCODE_MASK_H3B has no other users.

The new test gas/microblaze/bshift fails on its bslli and bsrai lines
without the opcodes change.

opcodes/
	* microblaze-opc.h (OPCODE_MASK_H3B): Include bits 21:22.

gas/
	* testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.exp: New file.
	* testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.s: New file.
	* testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.d: New test.

Assisted-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 gas/testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.d   | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 gas/testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.exp | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 gas/testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.s   | 10 ++++++++++
 opcodes/microblaze-opc.h                |  3 +--
 4 files changed, 49 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 gas/testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.d
 create mode 100644 gas/testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.exp
 create mode 100644 gas/testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.s

diff --git a/gas/testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.d b/gas/testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.d
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..45b855c0786
--- /dev/null
+++ b/gas/testsuite/gas/microblaze/bshift.d
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+#as:
+#objdump: -d
+
+.*: +file format .*
+
+Disassembly of section .text:
+
+00000000 <.text>:
+   0:	64e4041f 	bslli	r7, r4, 31
+   4:	64e4021f 	bsrai	r7, r4, 31
+   8:	64e4001f 	bsrli	r7, r4, 31
+   c:	64e40403 	bslli	r7, r4, 3
+  10:	64e40203 	bsrai	r7, r4, 3
+  14:	64e40003 	bsrli	r7, r4, 3
+  18:	44e42c00 	bsll	r7, r4, r5
+  1c:	44e42a00 	bsra	r7, r4, r5
+  20:	44e42800 	bsrl	r7, r4, r5
